  "title": "The Household Favorite",
  "description": "----\n#### **Description**\n*Vol.1:* Up until now, Daichi has lived alone with his doting grandmother, but after her tragic passing, he has to move in with his aunt and her two boys. There’s Shizuku, a pretty-boy who’s sweet and well-behaved… seemingly, that is… and Arashi, an aloof punk who has many admirers in spite of his rough demeanor. The two seem to have it out for each other, but are fond of Daichi for whatever reason. It’s nice being the center of attention, but he worries it won’t be long before things get out of hand…\n\n---\n\n*Vol.2:* Arashi makes a rare appearance at the academy to snap some pictures for his unusual hobby, but gets caught by Daichi, who'd gotten lost on the way to class. Arashi's sure that he's busted, but the not-so-bright boy doesn't seem to recognize him under all the makeup -- and happens to be a long-time simp for his online persona. He'd better be careful, though, as Daichi's quick to get the wrong impression and hard to stop once he gets going!\n\n---\n\n*Vol.3:* After getting kicked to the curb by his girlfriend, Arashi is forced to move back home, much to Shizuku’s chagrin. With Arashi still hot and bothered from his and Daichi’s encounter on campus (with Daichi still blissfully unaware who it was that he slept with in the first place) and Shizuku hell-bent on keeping others from playing with his toys, the house is a boiling powder keg of sexual tension that’s waiting to explode!\n\n----\n#### **Alternative Titles**\n- Domestic Love\n- Kateinai Henai\n- 家庭内偏愛\n\nStatus: Completed\n\nTags: Manga, Glasses-Wearing Character/s, Harem, Adult, Hentai, Sexual Acts, Handjob, Nakadashi, Oral Intercourse, Anilingus, Boys Love, Yaoi, Drama, Romance, Official English Uncensored",
